9. Conclusion

1. Non-trivial sheaf restricted to fixed-subspace monodromies; fixed-point-free twists produce spectral, not cohomological, obstruction.
2. Floor theorem restricted to graphs; general complexes include curl obstruction.
3. Energy landscape corrected; s_\perp update (1-\eta\lambda_2(L_0)); Hessian positive-definite condition.
4. Stability theorem rewritten as mean-square bound; H1 dropped.
5. Annulus replaces hexagon; non-vacuous.
6. Nonlinear gradient corrected: \nabla\mathcal{E}=L_0s+\nabla U(s).
7. Thermodynamic units (nats), coordinate dependence, speed-cost tradeoff addressed.
8. Real citations: Hansen–Ghrist (2019), Jiang–Lim–Yao–Ye (2011), Sivak–Crooks (2012), Anwer–Riess–Hale (2026).

